# Thinking Guides

## Scope

Shared project-wide engineering rules used by all packages and layers.

## Pre-Development Checklist

- Use the runtime config returned by context discovery, or read `.superwork/config.json`
- Read global and applicable shared rules, then the package/layer indexes for intended files before editing
- Load linked reference docs when their rules apply; reuse already-read guidance only while its content remains current and available
- Read applicable `AGENTS.md` instructions before changing files
- Keep project-specific contracts in `.superwork/spec/`, not in generated workflow copies

## Verification Checklist

- Require current verification evidence before any completion claim; reuse equivalent checks only when their inputs and environment remain unchanged, and rerun missing or invalidated checks
- Use project-local commands such as:
{{ test_hints }}

## Update Triggers

- A new cross-package rule was introduced
- A repeated bug pattern needs durable guidance
- A verification requirement now applies across the project
